    "detailed_description": "<h1>EA Update History</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1665260/extras/34414424121af4a1ecd500738033fda3.avif?t=1753292814\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1665260/extras/3367a961384a45e9a2d8c054aa037dfc.poster.avif?t=1753292814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1665260/extras/3367a961384a45e9a2d8c054aa037dfc.webm?t=1753292814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1665260/extras/3367a961384a45e9a2d8c054aa037dfc.mp4?t=1753292814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You awake from cryostasis with memories lost in the confusing fog of hypersleep. Immediately you begin to manifest powerful abilities. Lightning-fast reactions. Innate combat skills. Near-supernatural agility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your talents are quickly recognized. A mysterious woman named Yuri offers you a deal. In exchange for getting your memories back, you need to utilise your powers to become a street samurai in the crime-ridden, plague-stricken Sunset City. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1665260/extras/61f36312da6ae31833dd123290d32f3e.avif?t=1753292814\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1665260/extras/aa5647679ca70413979c2ce1b019ac5a.poster.avif?t=1753292814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1665260/extras/aa5647679ca70413979c2ce1b01